WEBVTT

01:18.450 --> 01:21.880
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:21.910 --> 01:24.750
[Episode 32]

01:26.920 --> 01:27.870
Hello.

01:28.430 --> 01:29.630
Hello, Miss Qian.

01:30.120 --> 01:31.070
We're sorry to inform you

01:31.070 --> 01:33.800
that you do not meet
our company's requirements.

01:36.890 --> 01:37.840
I see. Thank you.

01:44.270 --> 01:45.160
[Clary Construction Investment]

01:49.700 --> 01:51.690
[Jitonghui Securities]

02:02.060 --> 02:07.960
[Zhimei Construction Investment]

02:08.090 --> 02:11.750
[Little Smart Roams the Future]

02:20.290 --> 02:26.700
[Little Smart Roams the Future]

02:32.800 --> 02:33.430
Qian Fei,

02:34.540 --> 02:35.310
it's okay.

02:37.079 --> 02:39.940
This is only the 10th company
that has rejected you.

02:41.120 --> 02:42.160
Keep trying.

02:57.200 --> 02:58.460
[Hello, Ms. Qian Fei.]

02:58.480 --> 03:00.040
[I'm HR from Xinzouqi Capital Co., Ltd.]

03:00.060 --> 03:01.490
[I've reviewed your resume.
After a preliminary assessment,]

03:01.520 --> 03:02.820
[we think you'd be a good fit
for our company.]

03:02.850 --> 03:04.310
[We'd like to invite you to an interview
at 10:00 AM the day after tomorrow.]

03:04.340 --> 03:05.650
[Please reply to confirm it. Thank you.]

03:10.860 --> 03:11.970
[Jingjing]

03:20.810 --> 03:21.520
Hello.

03:22.190 --> 03:23.190
Hello, Jingjing.

03:23.890 --> 03:26.120
Did you send my resume
to Xinzouqi Capital?

03:26.120 --> 03:28.340
I've received their interview invitation.

03:28.340 --> 03:29.070
No, I didn't.

03:31.570 --> 03:33.290
That's weird then.

03:34.410 --> 03:37.320
I know the companies I've applied to.

03:37.810 --> 03:40.000
And I only shared my resume with you.

03:43.260 --> 03:44.380
I remember now.

03:44.820 --> 03:47.280
I once told Wang Ruohai about this.

03:48.710 --> 03:50.630
He said his former boss

03:50.630 --> 03:52.070
left the original bank

03:52.070 --> 03:54.040
and started his own venture capital firm.

03:54.040 --> 03:56.570
He's doing great
and hiring people right now.

03:56.760 --> 03:59.950
He thought this company
would be a good fit for you,

04:00.670 --> 04:02.440
and he could put in a good word for you,

04:02.440 --> 04:03.970
so he asked for your resume.

04:04.280 --> 04:05.550
Well, I actually...

04:06.110 --> 04:08.430
I didn't take what he said seriously.

04:08.850 --> 04:11.480
Never thought he'd actually get it done.

04:14.220 --> 04:15.170
Okay, I see.

04:15.990 --> 04:17.390
Alright, I'm hanging up.

04:29.600 --> 04:30.400
Who is it?

04:34.800 --> 04:36.770
Hello, are you Ms. Qian Fei?

04:37.230 --> 04:38.110
Yes.

04:38.130 --> 04:39.390
Here are your flowers.

04:40.600 --> 04:41.280
Thank you.

04:41.300 --> 04:41.960
No problem.

04:47.210 --> 04:50.330
[Let's start over. From Wang Ruohai.]

04:56.220 --> 04:59.310
[Blocked Contacts]

04:59.400 --> 04:59.620
[Blocked Contacts]

05:03.080 --> 05:03.650
[Calling]

05:08.690 --> 05:10.720
Wang Ruohai, what exactly are you up to?

05:10.720 --> 05:11.750
I just wanted you

05:11.750 --> 05:13.190
to take me off your blacklist.

05:13.190 --> 05:14.390
Looks like it worked.

05:15.900 --> 05:17.360
I don't want to talk to you.

05:35.750 --> 05:37.920
[Bad Name Took Me Forever]
[Streamer Center]

05:42.450 --> 05:44.280
[Bad Name Took Me Forever]
[Streamer Center]

05:49.320 --> 05:51.800
Today's game stream is over.

05:53.150 --> 05:55.600
But I'm in a good mood today.

05:56.400 --> 05:58.450
If anyone wants a chit-chat,

05:58.870 --> 06:00.530
I can chat with you for a while.

06:08.470 --> 06:11.720
Prime Minister,
you're using your mother's account again?

06:11.550 --> 06:13.730
[Bad Name Took Me Forever is live.]

06:12.230 --> 06:14.160
I successfully joined the stream.

06:16.330 --> 06:18.810
I can see myself!

06:19.430 --> 06:20.360
[Bad Name Took Me Forever]

06:20.440 --> 06:22.060
Jun, isn't this your mom?

06:22.090 --> 06:22.840
Peng Fei, Peng Fei.

06:22.840 --> 06:23.400
What's going on?

06:23.400 --> 06:24.600
Look, it's Jun's mom!

06:25.230 --> 06:25.960
It really is.

06:30.620 --> 06:31.690
Ma'am...

06:31.840 --> 06:33.870
No, I mean, Blue Baby Bear.

06:33.070 --> 06:35.770
[Bad Name Took Me Forever]
[Streamer Center]

06:34.400 --> 06:36.330
-Dang.
-Welcome to my livestream.

06:36.570 --> 06:38.940
Meeting you in this way
for the first time,

06:38.960 --> 06:40.159
I'm feeling a bit shy.

06:42.159 --> 06:43.540
Miss Bad Name,

06:43.570 --> 06:45.190
I am Blue Baby Bear.

06:45.230 --> 06:49.590
[Bad Name Took Me Forever is live.]

06:45.360 --> 06:49.740
Prime Minister and I
have always been following you closely.

06:49.870 --> 06:51.720
I-I've sent you many gifts.

06:51.720 --> 06:53.940
I've also been watching your livestream.

06:53.940 --> 06:55.600
-It's okay.
-It's not awkward at all.

06:55.500 --> 06:56.630
[Bad Name Took Me Forever]

06:55.620 --> 06:56.870
They're having a good time chatting.

06:56.800 --> 06:58.360
[Mom, stop messing around.
Get disconnected now.]

06:58.380 --> 06:59.980
[You're making Bad Name feel awkward.]

07:00.010 --> 07:01.340
[Prime Minister is dating Bad Name?]

07:01.360 --> 07:03.950
[Bad Name, your mother-in-law
has found out about your true colors.]

07:02.480 --> 07:03.940
Wait, what "true colors"?

07:03.970 --> 07:04.500
[Come back to our side.]

07:04.110 --> 07:06.310
I understand all this stuff
you say on the internet.

07:04.520 --> 07:06.230
[Peak "mother-in-law & daughter-in-law"
livestream moment]

07:07.080 --> 07:10.340
Ma'am, my fans are just
talking nonsense. Don't mind them.

07:12.100 --> 07:12.990
Listen,

07:12.990 --> 07:15.670
I'm not Miss Bad Name's mother-in-law.

07:14.700 --> 07:16.000
[Hold on...]

07:15.670 --> 07:17.920
But it's true
that Prime Minister is pursuing her.

07:16.030 --> 07:17.060
[What did I miss?]

07:17.080 --> 07:18.120
[No, you came at the perfect time.]

07:17.920 --> 07:19.430
Why are you guys so hyped?

07:19.550 --> 07:21.420
-If they end up falling out
-What are you doing? What is it?

07:21.420 --> 07:23.200
because of your provocation,

07:22.150 --> 07:25.520
[Bad Name Took Me Forever]

07:23.500 --> 07:25.740
I... I will blame all of you.

07:27.230 --> 07:29.810
Oh, my goodness!
Jun, what does your mom mean by this?

07:29.810 --> 07:32.470
She has won
the mother-in-law over, hasn't she?

07:32.550 --> 07:34.100
I thought your mom once said that she

07:34.100 --> 07:35.320
didn't like daughters-in-law
from other cities!

07:35.320 --> 07:35.930
Yes!

07:36.310 --> 07:38.350
Now that she's won the first prize
in the dance competition,

07:38.350 --> 07:40.310
the household registration issue
is settled, right?

07:40.310 --> 07:42.110
-Exactly!
-Sir, please stop it.

07:42.159 --> 07:44.320
I'm feeling so embarrassed!

07:45.600 --> 07:48.750
Bad Name, I've learned a dance.

07:48.750 --> 07:50.310
Let's interact a bit.

07:50.770 --> 07:52.140
[I never saw this coming.]

07:52.159 --> 07:53.490
[For the iconic moment.]

07:53.510 --> 07:54.790
[So cute.]

07:54.820 --> 07:56.020
[What is happening?]

07:56.040 --> 07:57.500
[Laughing out loud
for the first time today.]

07:58.240 --> 07:59.450
They're dancing! They're dancing!

07:59.450 --> 08:00.980
It's trending in the top 30!

08:01.310 --> 08:02.710
It's starting. Let's go.

08:14.210 --> 08:15.370
[Get more people there.] [So cute.]

08:15.390 --> 08:17.290
[So many people are watching.] [Don't
know this dance, but she's so pretty.]

08:19.280 --> 08:21.070
The fans who like

08:21.070 --> 08:23.470
Miss Bad Name,

08:23.550 --> 08:26.070
please subscribe

08:24.050 --> 08:25.100
[The madam is pretty cute.]

08:25.130 --> 08:26.660
[Excellent anchor and beautiful anchor]

08:26.680 --> 08:29.930
[Interesting] [Keep playing and dancing]

08:26.760 --> 08:28.360
and hit the "like" button.

08:28.550 --> 08:29.830
Don't hold back.

08:41.669 --> 08:43.190
The stream is now in the top five!

08:43.190 --> 08:44.670
Jun, your wife and your mom are

08:44.670 --> 08:47.310
the model mother-in-law
and daughter-in-law of the internet!

08:47.310 --> 08:48.040
Not bad!

08:48.040 --> 08:51.040
I didn't expect this would happen,
not even in my dreams!

08:51.040 --> 08:52.000
So nice.

09:51.880 --> 09:54.920
Fei, Wang Ruohai is sending me
a barrage of messages.

09:55.360 --> 09:57.120
Compared to how he used to be, I feel like

09:57.120 --> 09:59.330
he's a completely different person now.

09:59.330 --> 10:01.630
He claimed
that he sincerely wanted to win you back

10:01.630 --> 10:04.430
and asked me to persuade you
to go to the interview.

10:05.400 --> 10:06.420
To be honest,

10:06.450 --> 10:08.380
I think he's trying so hard to help you

10:08.380 --> 10:10.320
because he owes you in the first place.

10:10.320 --> 10:12.590
You don't need to feel any pressure.

10:12.710 --> 10:13.770
Most importantly,

10:13.820 --> 10:15.580
you're making
a major career change this time,

10:15.580 --> 10:16.650
and it's so hard.

10:16.870 --> 10:18.560
Realistically,

10:18.640 --> 10:21.840
I think you should
seize this opportunity he offered you.

10:24.560 --> 10:27.200
I see. I will go to the interview.

10:46.660 --> 10:47.930
Come on.

10:50.290 --> 10:52.030
I told you not to drink so much.

10:52.340 --> 10:54.100
But you just chugged it down.

10:55.330 --> 10:56.810
You're really something.

10:56.880 --> 10:57.680
Here, come on.

11:15.910 --> 11:17.170
Alright, I'm leaving.

11:56.570 --> 11:59.650
[Pretentious Li]

12:01.030 --> 12:03.440
Li Yifei has been on this business trip
for quite a while.

12:03.440 --> 12:05.040
It'd be great if he were here.

12:05.490 --> 12:07.870
At least he would
wring out a towel for me.

12:09.120 --> 12:10.250
[Pretentious Li]

12:20.020 --> 12:23.230
[Qian Fei]

12:26.360 --> 12:28.170
[Qian Fei]

12:47.570 --> 12:50.980
Li Yifei, are you that afraid
that I might cling to you?

13:08.070 --> 13:17.060
[Class Monitor]

13:27.120 --> 13:28.490
[Class Monitor]

13:33.210 --> 13:36.430
Young master, you finally called me back.

13:38.190 --> 13:39.790
Hello, Qian Fei?

13:41.960 --> 13:42.680
Monitor?

13:44.400 --> 13:45.040
What's up?

13:45.210 --> 13:46.640
You must come to be the bridesmaid

13:46.640 --> 13:48.240
when Mei and I hold the wedding.

13:48.240 --> 13:48.950
It's a deal.

13:49.910 --> 13:52.210
I've been a bridesmaid 3 times already.

13:52.950 --> 13:53.950
If I do it again,

13:54.650 --> 13:56.880
I won't be able to get married myself.

14:00.810 --> 14:01.450
Qian Fei,

14:02.060 --> 14:03.670
what's wrong with your voice?

14:03.670 --> 14:04.590
Are you sick?

14:04.890 --> 14:05.690
Where are you?

14:06.590 --> 14:08.930
I must be hallucinating.

14:10.680 --> 14:13.810
Why does your voice sound
more and more like Wang Ruohai?

14:18.690 --> 14:19.380
[Qian Fei]

14:23.900 --> 14:24.670
Qian Fei?

14:25.310 --> 14:25.930
Qian Fei.

14:27.530 --> 14:28.140
Qian Fei?

14:29.480 --> 14:30.480
Wake up, Qian Fei.

14:34.580 --> 14:35.700
Wang Ruohai?

14:37.470 --> 14:38.470
Why are you here?

14:39.830 --> 14:40.900
Wake up, Qian Fei.

14:41.270 --> 14:42.000
Are you okay?

14:43.260 --> 14:43.920
Qian Fei?

14:45.350 --> 14:47.570
Fortunately,
the patient is young and healthy.

14:47.570 --> 14:48.950
If she had arrived any later,

14:48.950 --> 14:50.810
it'd have turned into pneumonia.

14:51.050 --> 14:51.850
Doctor.

14:54.050 --> 14:54.850
You're awake.

14:55.280 --> 14:56.240
It's okay.

14:56.580 --> 14:57.810
Stay in the hospital
for observation for a day,

14:57.810 --> 14:59.610
and the nurse will give you an IV.

14:59.880 --> 15:00.640
Thank you.

15:45.010 --> 15:46.190
[Qian Fei] [Missed Call]

15:59.730 --> 16:02.170
I was having dinner
with my partners yesterday.

16:02.170 --> 16:03.500
I drank a little too much

16:03.860 --> 16:05.520
and didn't hear my phone ring.

16:27.790 --> 16:28.580
You're awake.

16:28.580 --> 16:29.710
Want to get up? Here.

16:39.120 --> 16:39.890
What are you looking for?

16:39.890 --> 16:41.050
Where is my phone?

16:41.690 --> 16:43.890
I put it away,
so it wouldn't disturb your rest.

16:43.890 --> 16:45.340
I'll let you know
if someone tries to reach you.

16:45.340 --> 16:46.450
I need it right now.

16:49.710 --> 16:50.440
Here you are.

16:51.560 --> 16:52.120
Thanks.

17:03.510 --> 17:05.359
I also forgot what I was going to say.

17:05.359 --> 17:07.220
Just focus on your business trip.

17:31.390 --> 17:38.020
[I also forgot what I was going to say.
Just focus on your business trip.]

17:49.080 --> 17:50.290
Qian Fei,

17:51.600 --> 17:52.710
what are you doing?

18:03.430 --> 18:04.740
I got you some food.

18:05.190 --> 18:06.450
Eat it while it's warm.

18:19.430 --> 18:20.010
Here,

18:20.340 --> 18:21.200
let me feed you.

18:26.430 --> 18:26.950
Here.

18:27.360 --> 18:29.360
-It's not bad, right?
-Give it to me.

18:50.950 --> 18:52.550
Don't you need to work today?

18:53.020 --> 18:54.020
I took the day off.

18:55.430 --> 18:57.990
You're pretty good
at taking care of people now.

18:57.990 --> 18:58.910
I remember

18:59.150 --> 19:00.720
when we were together before.

19:00.720 --> 19:02.400
I used to work late all the time,

19:02.400 --> 19:04.130
yet you never came to pick me up.

19:04.210 --> 19:04.970
Now

19:05.400 --> 19:07.330
you're taking such good care of me.

19:09.560 --> 19:11.220
You took care of me for 5 years.

19:11.230 --> 19:12.760
I learned just by watching.

19:13.750 --> 19:15.300
Actually, it's not that
I didn't know how to do it back then.

19:15.300 --> 19:16.640
It's just that I knew deep down

19:16.640 --> 19:17.890
that no matter how I treated you,

19:17.890 --> 19:19.290
you would never leave me.

19:19.510 --> 19:20.550
So I got lazy.

19:20.730 --> 19:21.990
That's quite sincere.

19:23.710 --> 19:24.670
Why do you make it

19:24.670 --> 19:26.230
sound like I did something wrong

19:26.230 --> 19:28.630
and gave you too much
of a sense of security?

19:29.110 --> 19:30.920
Well, you did teach me a lesson.

19:36.550 --> 19:37.240
Thank you.

19:43.510 --> 19:44.130
Qian Fei.

19:45.970 --> 19:47.180
If a man

19:47.290 --> 19:49.390
feels like he can easily control you,

19:50.140 --> 19:52.000
he will start to cherish you less.

19:52.690 --> 19:54.210
Sometimes, he won't even bother replying

19:54.210 --> 19:55.570
to your messages quickly.

19:55.570 --> 19:56.290
Being busy is

19:56.290 --> 19:57.570
just an excuse men use.

20:00.740 --> 20:01.520
I don't want

20:01.890 --> 20:03.290
to see you get hurt again.

20:03.410 --> 20:04.140
Wang Ruohai,

20:04.560 --> 20:05.890
did you check my phone?

20:06.050 --> 20:06.530
Nope.

20:09.660 --> 20:11.520
I just noticed the way you looked—

20:11.540 --> 20:13.790
you looked like you were
waiting for someone's reply.

20:13.790 --> 20:15.750
Can you stop making wild guesses?

20:15.860 --> 20:16.790
Okay, fine.

20:17.520 --> 20:18.280
You are sick.

20:18.340 --> 20:19.800
If you say so, then so be it.

20:48.170 --> 20:49.500
Mr. Li, come in, please.

20:57.250 --> 20:59.110
You have elegant taste, Mr. Sang.

20:59.180 --> 21:00.710
Come on, Mr. Li, take a seat.

21:04.880 --> 21:06.110
Mr. Li, I heard you've been

21:06.110 --> 21:08.020
on the Fulaxida project
all the time recently.

21:08.020 --> 21:08.680
Yeah.

21:10.830 --> 21:12.090
Looks like your skin's

21:12.430 --> 21:14.010
gotten a healthier tan.

21:16.520 --> 21:19.440
Fulaxida has also been facing
constant problems lately.

21:19.440 --> 21:21.410
They've been stuck in the mountains.

21:21.410 --> 21:22.950
Now, those minor shareholders

21:22.950 --> 21:25.070
all think their money
has gone down the drain.

21:25.070 --> 21:28.530
They keep calling me all day long,
wanting to track the project.

21:28.530 --> 21:29.620
Meanwhile,

21:30.310 --> 21:32.970
Mr. Sang, you have a better temper
and stay calm.

21:33.730 --> 21:35.730
You're even in the mood for running.

21:50.110 --> 21:51.200
Honestly,

21:53.120 --> 21:54.730
I've heard a little about

21:55.490 --> 21:57.400
what's happening in Fulaxida.

21:57.650 --> 21:58.680
But I believe that

21:59.160 --> 22:00.770
with your capability, Mr. Li,

22:00.770 --> 22:03.090
you certainly won't let me suffer losses.

22:03.090 --> 22:04.090
Not necessarily.

22:05.940 --> 22:07.540
Take a look at this document.

22:08.000 --> 22:09.600
It concerns your interests.

22:19.190 --> 22:20.070
[Share Termination Contract]

22:20.340 --> 22:21.050
[Party A: Sanglin Group Co., Ltd.]

22:21.080 --> 22:22.220
[Termination Contract]

22:40.150 --> 22:43.870
[Sanglin Group Co., Ltd.]

22:41.690 --> 22:43.840
Mr. Li, what do you mean by this?

22:45.470 --> 22:47.390
I mean exactly
what is written in this document.

22:47.390 --> 22:50.790
Let's terminate the contract.
We're no longer cooperating.

22:51.710 --> 22:55.220
Mr. Sang, keep the drama you staged

22:55.240 --> 22:56.810
to yourself.

22:57.680 --> 23:00.330
Fulaxida has never been,
and will never be,

23:01.020 --> 23:02.360
a tool for you

23:02.360 --> 23:04.080
to easily rake in money.

23:04.470 --> 23:05.280
Understand?

23:07.170 --> 23:08.390
Do you know

23:08.760 --> 23:10.000
what you are doing?

23:11.740 --> 23:13.470
I couldn't be clearer about it.

23:16.100 --> 23:17.830
You want to kick me out, right?

23:22.570 --> 23:23.320
Fine.

23:25.230 --> 23:26.580
But before that,

23:27.040 --> 23:28.490
I also have a contract

23:29.040 --> 23:30.570
for you, Mr. Li,

23:31.560 --> 23:32.620
to take a look.

24:08.370 --> 24:10.540
[Sanglin Group Co., Ltd.]

24:16.640 --> 24:17.510
Y-Yifei,

24:17.960 --> 24:18.940
hear me out.

24:19.170 --> 24:21.630
I really didn't know
signing that was a trap.

24:21.830 --> 24:22.860
They told me that

24:22.990 --> 24:24.700
if I signed this technical contract

24:24.700 --> 24:26.360
as the legal representative,

24:26.560 --> 24:28.400
it would be like adding a lock

24:28.400 --> 24:29.810
to the project's funding.

24:29.810 --> 24:31.220
So you signed it?

24:32.470 --> 24:33.120
They said

24:33.240 --> 24:35.840
this contract could be terminated
at any time.

24:38.800 --> 24:40.360
Didn't you know that

24:40.360 --> 24:42.230
the contract had been tampered with?

24:42.230 --> 24:44.490
Yifei, don't... don't scare me.

24:44.990 --> 24:45.750
I was wrong.

24:45.750 --> 24:47.950
I'll accept any punishment you give me.

24:48.260 --> 24:49.500
What should we do now?

24:51.420 --> 24:52.560
But things are no longer

24:52.560 --> 24:54.020
the way you think they are.

24:57.240 --> 24:59.240
Explain it clearly, Li Yifei!

25:00.360 --> 25:01.640
Don't tell me Fulaxida will end up

25:01.640 --> 25:03.040
belonging to Sang Shiqi!

25:03.460 --> 25:07.040
Today, I came to force Mr. Sang
to withdraw his investment in Fulaxida,

25:07.040 --> 25:08.790
but I was actually
just trying to provoke him.

25:08.790 --> 25:11.190
I wanted to see
the last thing up his sleeve.

25:13.800 --> 25:15.530
Y-You mean

25:15.760 --> 25:17.760
you already knew he wouldn't agree?

25:17.870 --> 25:18.290
Yes.

25:19.860 --> 25:21.230
And I made him expose

25:21.230 --> 25:22.690
the real power behind him.

25:23.320 --> 25:23.920
Who is it?

25:24.810 --> 25:25.930
Liao Jinshan.

25:27.800 --> 25:29.010
Are you sure?

25:29.860 --> 25:32.010
Today, he took out that tampered contract

25:32.010 --> 25:33.210
to force me to give in.

25:33.890 --> 25:36.150
I can't be more familiar with this trick.

25:37.790 --> 25:40.610
When Qiansheng Group
went public in the US,

25:40.870 --> 25:43.870
Liao Jinshan used this exact trick
against my family.

25:43.900 --> 25:45.140
It's just that I was

25:45.610 --> 25:47.710
too young to take part in it back then.

25:48.630 --> 25:50.490
I heard about it from my dad later.

25:51.470 --> 25:54.140
Should I say you're lucky or you're smart?

25:54.160 --> 25:57.100
All right.
Now that we know who our enemy is,

25:57.120 --> 25:58.940
it'll be easier for us
to fight the next battle.

25:58.940 --> 25:59.940
It's not over yet.

26:03.950 --> 26:05.320
Besides Liao Jinshan,

26:07.080 --> 26:08.340
there's someone else.

26:08.910 --> 26:11.250
You... You mean there's one more mole?

26:11.750 --> 26:12.180
Yep.

26:14.290 --> 26:16.690
Only people familiar with my usual style

26:17.710 --> 26:19.290
would clearly know that

26:19.320 --> 26:21.520
I would use shares to confront Mr. Sang.

26:24.980 --> 26:26.900
Oh, Li Yifei,

26:27.100 --> 26:29.360
so you've been setting up such a big trap!

26:29.900 --> 26:31.180
You even kept it from me.

26:31.180 --> 26:32.210
That's not cool!

26:33.470 --> 26:34.380
I have no choice.

26:34.380 --> 26:36.110
Only by hiding it from everyone

26:36.350 --> 26:38.330
can I catch the real mole.

26:43.020 --> 26:43.570
Okay.

26:50.430 --> 26:54.110
[Zhonggeng Global Creative Center]

26:53.630 --> 26:55.640
Qian Fei, I've seen you before.

26:55.720 --> 26:57.840
I saw you at the company entrance
when you were waiting

26:57.840 --> 26:59.320
for Wang Ruohai to get off work.

26:59.320 --> 27:00.450
I've seen you, too.

27:00.470 --> 27:02.510
After founding Xinzouqi Capital,

27:02.540 --> 27:03.910
you've made frequent appearances
in the media.

27:03.910 --> 27:05.320
Having made a new venture capital firm

27:05.320 --> 27:06.560
so competitive

27:06.560 --> 27:08.090
in such a short time—

27:08.190 --> 27:09.720
I think it's truly amazing.

27:10.130 --> 27:10.730
Thank you.

27:12.220 --> 27:14.140
We've all reviewed your resume.

27:12.330 --> 27:16.010
[Xinzouqi Capital Co., Ltd.]

27:14.430 --> 27:15.520
We've also conducted

27:15.520 --> 27:18.190
background checks on your work history

27:18.600 --> 27:19.880
and why you left He Jing Securities.

27:19.880 --> 27:20.820
Frankly speaking,

27:20.820 --> 27:22.400
even if we set aside

27:22.430 --> 27:23.870
the reason you were dismissed,

27:23.870 --> 27:25.520
I believe this incident

27:25.540 --> 27:28.670
has a major impact on your career
in investment banking.

27:28.920 --> 27:31.210
It's not devastating, though.

27:32.020 --> 27:34.660
I think you could
transition into the back office

27:32.900 --> 27:36.730
[Xinzouqi Capital Co., Ltd.]

27:34.820 --> 27:36.940
or pass other qualification exams

27:37.150 --> 27:38.890
to get back into investment banking.

27:38.890 --> 27:39.970
But why

27:39.860 --> 27:43.780
[Xinzouqi Capital Co., Ltd.]

27:40.260 --> 27:42.790
would you choose
a small venture capital firm

27:42.790 --> 27:43.710
like ours?

27:44.750 --> 27:45.600
I've worked

27:45.600 --> 27:47.860
at He Jing Securities since graduation.

27:48.050 --> 27:49.710
It helped me grow significantly

27:49.710 --> 27:51.790
and broadened my horizons
in the financial industry.

27:51.790 --> 27:53.920
Especially in back-end data analysis

27:53.950 --> 27:55.430
and front-end project preparation,

27:55.430 --> 27:57.100
it allowed me
to accumulate a lot of experience.

27:57.100 --> 27:58.860
As for the reason I was dismissed,

27:58.860 --> 28:03.500
[Xinzouqi Capital Co., Ltd.]

27:59.270 --> 28:00.450
I could have simply used

28:00.450 --> 28:02.150
the company's internal adjustments

28:02.150 --> 28:03.630
as an excuse to explain it.

28:04.290 --> 28:06.070
But actually, regarding this incident,

28:06.070 --> 28:07.820
the biggest lesson it taught me is that

28:07.820 --> 28:10.180
when facing the industry's unspoken rules,

28:10.180 --> 28:12.440
you either accept them and adapt to them,

28:12.810 --> 28:14.270
or you step away from them.

28:14.490 --> 28:17.040
And I chose
to stay true to my original intention.

28:17.040 --> 28:19.970
I don't want to force myself
for the sake of my future.

28:20.300 --> 28:23.230
So I chose to leave investment banking
and come here.

28:24.350 --> 28:25.460
How do you know that

28:25.840 --> 28:27.700
you can realize your original intention

28:27.700 --> 28:29.500
here at Xinzouqi Capital?

28:31.090 --> 28:32.400
Actually, before coming to the interview,

28:32.400 --> 28:35.430
I investigated every project
Xinzouqi Capital has invested in

28:35.430 --> 28:37.510
since its establishment.

28:37.530 --> 28:39.320
Although I wasn't involved in them,

28:39.320 --> 28:40.710
I could tell that

28:40.710 --> 28:42.660
under your leadership, Xinzouqi Capital

28:42.660 --> 28:43.670
is not just

28:43.670 --> 28:45.510
a profit-seeking venture capital firm

28:45.510 --> 28:47.510
but a capital bridge
with a forward-looking vision

28:47.510 --> 28:49.800
and a sense of social responsibility.

28:51.730 --> 28:52.930
Then how do you define

28:52.950 --> 28:55.700
the essence of equity investment?

28:55.890 --> 28:57.640
I think equity investment is

28:57.670 --> 28:59.710
actually a relationship
between zero and one.

28:59.710 --> 29:01.120
It's either zero or one.

29:01.120 --> 29:03.120
There is actually no middle ground.

29:03.420 --> 29:05.270
If you win,

29:05.270 --> 29:06.400
you get returns.

29:06.400 --> 29:08.260
If you lose, you lose everything.

29:08.680 --> 29:10.750
There's only one way to win,

29:11.400 --> 29:12.560
which is to help enterprises

29:12.560 --> 29:14.800
create real value for society.

29:24.580 --> 29:25.310
We're glad

29:25.770 --> 29:28.040
to have you join us at Xinzouqi Capital.

29:28.070 --> 29:30.640
Let's work together

29:30.670 --> 29:32.130
to help more enterprises.

29:32.410 --> 29:33.200
Thank you.

29:33.070 --> 29:35.690
[Xinzouqi Capital Co., Ltd.]

29:35.820 --> 29:37.360
Look, No. 9 and No. 10,

29:37.360 --> 29:38.120
as well as No. 1,

29:38.120 --> 29:39.880
have these field controllers installed.

29:39.880 --> 29:41.080
The rest of them are still

29:41.080 --> 29:42.880
under construction currently.

29:48.490 --> 29:49.470
Are you exhausted

29:49.470 --> 29:51.600
from running around the past few days?

29:53.960 --> 29:55.670
Well, if so, you should go back first.

29:55.670 --> 29:58.130
We're almost done anyway.
That's almost it.

29:58.670 --> 30:00.870
Okay, thank you for your hard work, too.

30:01.190 --> 30:01.710
Okay.

30:02.730 --> 30:04.130
By the way, um,

30:04.210 --> 30:05.670
Qian Fei has found a new job.

30:05.670 --> 30:06.880
My wife called me.

30:07.030 --> 30:09.130
She said Qian Fei's working
at Xinzouqi Capital now.

30:09.130 --> 30:11.130
She's switched to venture capital.

30:12.480 --> 30:13.510
Xinzouqi?

30:15.190 --> 30:16.520
How did she get in there?

30:19.990 --> 30:22.450
That's not something confidential, right?

30:23.780 --> 30:25.910
I think it was because of Wang Ruohai.

30:26.270 --> 30:29.100
He used to be the subordinate
of Xinzouqi's boss.

30:30.010 --> 30:31.870
After hearing
that Qian Fei was looking for a job,

30:31.870 --> 30:34.600
he put in a good word for her
with Xinzouqi's boss.

30:36.190 --> 30:37.390
When did this happen?

30:38.630 --> 30:40.560
In the last couple of days, I think.

30:49.450 --> 30:51.650
What? Are you panicking?

30:57.280 --> 30:58.850
It just occurred to me that

31:00.730 --> 31:03.370
Qian Fei sent me WeChat messages
a few days ago.

31:03.720 --> 31:05.720
I guess it was about her job hunting.

31:08.740 --> 31:11.270
She must have been very helpless
at that time,

31:12.430 --> 31:14.610
but I couldn't help her at all.

31:17.310 --> 31:19.570
Hey, why are you being so indecisive now?

31:20.170 --> 31:21.220
Actually,

31:22.670 --> 31:25.000
I've always been sure
that I like Qian Fei.

31:26.340 --> 31:27.270
But does Qian Fei

31:30.010 --> 31:31.250
really like me, too?

31:31.790 --> 31:32.890
Or in other words,

31:34.030 --> 31:34.760
would she...

31:35.950 --> 31:36.950
accept me?

31:39.360 --> 31:40.560
Hold on, hold on...

31:41.120 --> 31:43.190
Y-You two have lived together for so long.

31:43.190 --> 31:44.030
Can't you even tell

31:44.030 --> 31:45.630
whether she likes you or not?

31:46.250 --> 31:47.800
Hey, when it comes to women,

31:47.800 --> 31:49.800
aren't you an expert?

31:50.560 --> 31:52.630
It's different now.

31:53.710 --> 31:56.560
Liking someone and loving someone
are even more different.

31:56.560 --> 31:57.820
I'm serious this time.

31:58.330 --> 32:00.100
I want to marry her.

32:02.860 --> 32:04.460
Then what are you doing here?

32:06.240 --> 32:07.390
It's a long story.

32:08.250 --> 32:09.880
I wanted to use this trip

32:09.900 --> 32:11.160
to completely sort out

32:11.160 --> 32:12.160
my thoughts.

32:14.240 --> 32:15.640
I was nervous, after all.

32:16.560 --> 32:18.620
But I happened to overlook one thing.

32:20.650 --> 32:23.780
She couldn't possibly just stay in place
waiting for me.

32:25.900 --> 32:27.700
There's nothing between us yet.

32:28.780 --> 32:30.160
She has no obligation to do so, either.

32:30.160 --> 32:31.050
Stop it.

32:32.740 --> 32:33.820
All right, look.

32:35.770 --> 32:37.450
Tell me how you feel

32:37.470 --> 32:38.630
right now.

32:40.740 --> 32:42.690
I never stop yearning to see her.

32:44.660 --> 32:47.010
But there are no more flights today.

32:48.910 --> 32:50.770
I'll fly early tomorrow morning.

32:51.150 --> 32:52.250
I'll leave this to you.

32:52.250 --> 32:53.180
I believe in you.

32:54.560 --> 32:55.120
Okay!

32:55.760 --> 32:56.520
You got this!

33:05.320 --> 33:08.950
[Exit]

33:19.350 --> 33:22.480
Help me book a table with a view
at an Italian restaurant.

33:24.150 --> 33:25.000
At 5:00 PM.

33:26.470 --> 33:27.110
For two.

33:28.890 --> 33:29.820
Okay, thank you.

33:39.520 --> 33:42.130
[Xinzouqi Capital Co., Ltd.]

33:45.820 --> 33:48.760
[Pretentious Li]

33:57.250 --> 33:57.830
Hello?

33:59.430 --> 34:01.010
Landlady, I'm back.

34:06.380 --> 34:07.050
Well...

34:08.699 --> 34:11.050
Are you free this afternoon?
Let's have dinner together.

34:11.050 --> 34:12.850
And I have something to tell you.

34:13.210 --> 34:14.000
Okay.

34:14.929 --> 34:16.929
Alright, I'll send you the address.

34:17.360 --> 34:18.159
See you later.

34:18.530 --> 34:19.500
At 5:00 PM.

34:34.400 --> 34:36.760
Mr. Liu, let's go to No. 520 Flower Shop

34:36.840 --> 34:38.030
in Lujiazui first.

34:38.429 --> 34:38.989
Got it.

34:42.389 --> 34:46.590
♪ No need to guess the ending
right from the beginning ♪

34:49.219 --> 34:54.630
♪ Let the melody play
among the chords and the wind ♪

34:57.210 --> 35:02.790
♪ And no need to demand
that yesterday keeps its promises ♪

35:03.980 --> 35:09.480
♪ Leave some surprises in life
to the unknown ♪

35:05.110 --> 35:07.170
Li Yifei wants to have dinner with me.

35:08.300 --> 35:09.860
What is he going to tell me?

35:12.390 --> 35:17.550
♪ No need to use a few fragments
of the past to define the whole story ♪

35:12.790 --> 35:15.320
Maybe he wants to tell me
not to think too much.

35:18.430 --> 35:24.090
♪ Somehow, a little heartbreak
awakens the poet within ♪

35:27.220 --> 35:32.720
♪ There's also no need
to give up because of the past ♪

35:33.610 --> 35:39.130
♪ I need some courage to get praises ♪

35:39.970 --> 35:43.020
♪ I'll show you the wider world ♪

35:43.660 --> 35:46.770
♪ It's only in blazing bright
that I am who I am ♪

35:47.840 --> 35:53.950
♪ Quietly carry it all, like a harbor
sheltering your drifting soul ♪

35:55.430 --> 35:57.720
♪ When you return to your peaceful life ♪

35:58.750 --> 36:01.650
♪ The light at home glows warm
day and night ♪

36:02.760 --> 36:04.380
♪ Stay forever by each other's side ♪

36:05.410 --> 36:07.860
♪ Like the stars and the moon
hanging brightly in the sky ♪

36:09.820 --> 36:12.150
♪ I'll show you the wider world ♪

36:13.160 --> 36:16.150
♪ It's only in blazing bright
that I am who I am ♪

36:17.690 --> 36:23.540
♪ Quietly carry it all, like a harbor
sheltering your drifting soul ♪

36:24.660 --> 36:26.840
♪ When you return to your peaceful life ♪

36:27.860 --> 36:31.480
♪ The light at home glows warm
day and night ♪

36:32.520 --> 36:35.040
♪ Stay forever by each other's side ♪

36:36.990 --> 36:43.650
♪ Like the stars and the moon
hanging brightly in the sky ♪

36:45.030 --> 36:46.650
Isn't it weird to dress this formally?

36:46.650 --> 36:47.650
Not at all.

36:47.930 --> 36:49.130
It's about attitude.

37:17.690 --> 37:18.290
Why did you

37:19.060 --> 37:20.720
suddenly lose so much weight?

37:21.430 --> 37:21.990
Did I?

37:22.810 --> 37:24.990
Maybe it's due to the fever I had before.

37:24.990 --> 37:25.850
You had a fever?

37:27.350 --> 37:28.210
What happened?

37:28.720 --> 37:30.850
It's okay. It happened a long time ago.

37:34.730 --> 37:35.330
By the way,

37:36.210 --> 37:37.250
this is for you.

37:40.790 --> 37:41.990
Open it to have a look.

37:49.530 --> 37:50.330
Do you like it?

37:50.950 --> 37:52.010
It's quite pretty.

37:56.500 --> 37:58.510
Oh, right, didn't you say on the phone
that you had something to tell me?

37:58.510 --> 37:59.110
What is it?

38:06.680 --> 38:07.320
Qian Fei.

38:10.320 --> 38:10.680
I...

38:16.550 --> 38:17.070
Actually, I...

38:17.070 --> 38:18.200
Then let me go first.

38:25.150 --> 38:25.860
Li Yifei.

38:28.400 --> 38:29.530
I missed you so much.

38:31.700 --> 38:32.900
I couldn't help

38:35.270 --> 38:37.110
but think of your cheeky look.

38:39.970 --> 38:40.660
Really?

38:41.140 --> 38:42.240
Actually, I also want to say...

38:42.240 --> 38:43.370
Let me finish first.

38:51.330 --> 38:52.200
I would

38:53.600 --> 38:54.870
often check my phone

38:56.330 --> 38:58.550
to see if you've sent me any messages.

39:00.300 --> 39:03.100
My mind is also consumed by you.

39:04.810 --> 39:06.150
Whether I like it or not,

39:07.410 --> 39:08.610
you are always there.

39:10.940 --> 39:11.860
However,

39:12.510 --> 39:14.170
I've also realized one thing.

39:14.930 --> 39:16.660
You make me feel very insecure.

39:22.480 --> 39:24.630
I hate waiting and guessing like this.

39:25.450 --> 39:27.510
I don't like myself like this either.

39:31.170 --> 39:32.290
But I like you.

39:32.980 --> 39:39.280
♪ Whenever I look up ♪

39:39.250 --> 39:39.980
Qian Fei...

39:39.940 --> 39:46.400
♪ I ran into your eyes ♪

39:43.080 --> 39:44.680
I'm sure I've fallen for you.

39:47.360 --> 39:53.670
♪ Trying to catch that pleasant light ♪

39:48.920 --> 39:50.500
I know I

39:50.730 --> 39:51.980
have a lot of flaws

39:53.210 --> 39:54.270
and shortcomings.

39:54.780 --> 40:00.920
♪ To embrace that fleeting moment
of happiness ♪

39:55.990 --> 39:57.590
I'm always self-conceited,

39:58.830 --> 40:00.230
and I always mess with you

40:01.240 --> 40:02.500
and get on your nerves.

40:02.740 --> 40:08.960
♪ Sometimes I cry,
and sometimes I'm happy ♪

40:05.010 --> 40:06.940
I really haven't been good enough.

40:08.220 --> 40:09.560
But it's different now.

40:10.150 --> 40:16.420
♪ Sometimes I feel
I've captured the sweetness ♪

40:10.550 --> 40:11.740
I have a direction.

40:12.650 --> 40:14.500
I know what I should do next.

40:17.410 --> 40:18.950
Can you give me a chance, Qian Fei?

40:17.520 --> 40:24.000
♪ Sometimes, I run,
and sometimes, I fall ♪

40:24.510 --> 40:25.550
Let's be together.

40:24.880 --> 40:31.430
♪ Sometimes I feel
that having you is the best thing ♪

40:27.220 --> 40:28.150
Be together?

40:30.920 --> 40:32.560
You disappear when you want,

40:32.650 --> 40:38.540
♪ I've never loved anyone
like I love you ♪

40:32.710 --> 40:34.060
appear when you want,

40:34.580 --> 40:36.380
and say you love me when you want.

40:37.010 --> 40:39.230
Now you want us to be together
just because you want to?

40:39.230 --> 40:46.130
♪ Without any hesitation ♪

40:40.000 --> 40:42.530
What? Do you think I'm a fool

40:42.660 --> 40:43.750
who will just follow your orders?

40:43.750 --> 40:45.350
It's not like that, Qian Fei.

40:46.050 --> 40:46.970
I just wanted to

40:47.390 --> 40:48.720
take this business trip as a chance

40:47.500 --> 40:53.810
♪ I've never been loved like you love me ♪

40:49.120 --> 40:50.380
to sober up completely

40:50.430 --> 40:51.430
and figure out

40:51.430 --> 40:52.690
what I really wanted

40:53.060 --> 40:54.660
and what our future would be like.

40:54.660 --> 41:01.040
♪ In short, I'll wait for my love ♪

40:59.830 --> 41:01.290
But I realized I was wrong.

41:03.030 --> 41:08.670
♪ I've never seen a bright sea like you ♪

41:05.450 --> 41:06.720
I overcomplicated

41:06.720 --> 41:07.830
a simple thing.

41:09.910 --> 41:16.280
♪ Every minute is colorful ♪

41:11.220 --> 41:12.620
Liking is simply liking.

41:13.860 --> 41:15.900
I believe you feel the same way.

41:16.770 --> 41:18.530
Neither of us can lie to ourselves.

41:18.070 --> 41:23.480
♪ I've never experienced
such a warm love as yours ♪

41:24.270 --> 41:31.530
♪ In short, I won't let go of my hand ♪

41:28.430 --> 41:29.780
I admit that last time,

41:31.330 --> 41:32.560
I did run away.

41:33.180 --> 41:34.560
If I've hurt you,

41:35.890 --> 41:36.810
I apologize.

41:37.730 --> 41:38.400
I'm sorry.

41:38.430 --> 41:40.290
You don't need to apologize to me.

41:40.850 --> 41:42.830
Do you realize how selfish you are?

41:43.390 --> 41:45.760
You... You can't hurt me again anyway.

41:46.730 --> 41:48.660
I won't give you that chance again.

41:49.160 --> 41:54.540
♪ I've never loved anyone
like I love you ♪

41:50.750 --> 41:52.060
I've made my choice.

41:55.740 --> 42:02.520
♪ Without any hesitation ♪

42:04.010 --> 42:09.890
♪ I've never been loved like you love me ♪

42:11.180 --> 42:17.220
♪ In short, I'll wait for my love ♪

42:19.540 --> 42:24.600
♪ I've never seen a bright sea like you ♪

42:26.030 --> 42:32.350
♪ Every minute is colorful ♪

42:28.290 --> 42:30.680
Hello, we've finished
moving things out here.

42:30.680 --> 42:31.740
Please take a look.

42:32.220 --> 42:32.670
Okay.

42:33.880 --> 42:39.670
♪ I've never experienced
such a warm love as yours ♪

42:40.400 --> 42:48.230
♪ In short, I won't let go of my hand ♪

42:45.770 --> 42:46.760
Thank you for your hard work.

42:46.760 --> 42:48.220
You're welcome. Goodbye.

42:52.020 --> 42:53.670
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:54.070 --> 42:55.940
Didn't you say you were no longer
obsessed with love

42:55.940 --> 42:57.040
and can rationally think about

42:57.040 --> 42:58.640
your future relationships?

42:58.680 --> 43:00.610
You're completely hopeless.

42:58.940 --> 43:01.130
[Daisy flower language: You're the love
I've hidden deep down inside.]

43:00.680 --> 43:02.680
You've fallen in love with Li Yifei.

43:12.740 --> 43:14.730
[I've figured out a plan
and will contact you later.]

43:13.840 --> 43:14.520
I'm looking for someone.

43:14.520 --> 43:15.140
Sorry.

43:16.400 --> 43:17.400
Do you know which room the guest

43:17.400 --> 43:18.370
you're looking for is in?
